[I] An unicode improved version of rxvt

[T] Rxvt-unicode is a unicode improved version of rxvt.

[U] http://software.schmorp.de/pkg/rxvt-unicode

[A] Marc Alexander Lehmann <pcg@goof.com>
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/shell
[F] CROSS

[E] opt gdk-pixbuf glib
[E] opt startup-notification glib

[L] GPL
[V] 9.32

[D] ad85c8acb2fc22d47cf8ab352e7b83ca973c0d2cf71d4bd77cec3d2e rxvt-unicode-9.32.tar.bz2 http://rxvt-unicode-dist.plan9.de/

var_append GCC_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' -std=c++14
var_append confopt ' ' --enable-everything
atstage cross && var_append confopt ' ' '--disable-perl' && export TERMINFO=$root/usr/share/terminfo
[ "$SDECFG_LIBC" = 'musl' ] && var_append confopt ' ' --disable-utmp
